---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import BookingLink from '../../components/BookingLink.astro';
import DiscoveryCall from '../../components/DiscoveryCall.astro';
import { coaching } from '../../config/services.mjs';
---
<SiteLayout service="coaching" title="AI coaching | TJ Maynes" description={`One-to-one AI automation coaching with TJ Maynes for professionals working on tasks from their jobs. Sessions are $${coaching.price} ${coaching.currency} for ${coaching.minutes} minutes.}`}>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="coaching-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Coaching</p>
      <h1 id="coaching-title">I teach professionals how to automate their work.</h1>
      <p class="lead">I offer one-to-one sessions for people who want to use AI and automation in their jobs. We’ll work on a task you bring, and I’ll help you learn how to build it and check that it works.</p>
      <p class="price">${coaching.price} {coaching.currency} <span>for {coaching.minutes} minutes</span></p>
      <div class="actions"><BookingLink service="coaching" placement="hero" /><span class="call-note">Free 15-minute call</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap split" aria-labelledby="session-title">
      <div><h2 id="session-title">What a session is like</h2></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>I’ll ask about your task and what you’ve already tried. Then we’ll break it into steps and choose something small enough to work on during the session.</p>
        <p>You’ll share your screen and do most of the building. I’ll pair with you, explain things as they come up, and help when you get stuck. We’ll try different inputs and check what the automation does.</p>
        <p>At the end, we’ll review what you’ve learned and choose something to practice. I’ll send a brief recap. If we continue, I’ll keep a short roadmap with you and adjust it as you make progress.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap split" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
      <div><h2 id="tools-title">Tools we can work with</h2></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>We can use n8n to connect apps and build workflows, Codex to work on scripts or small tools, and Claude for tasks such as drafting updates or extracting information. For coding tasks, we can also use Claude Code.</p>
        <p>You don’t need to be a developer to get started. Some goals work well with visual tools; others need code or several sessions. We’ll talk about that before booking.</p>
        <p>I’ll confirm the setup with you beforehand, including any software costs. Please use examples you’re allowed to share and check your employer’s policies on AI tools. We can work with fictional data when needed.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section wrap split" aria-labelledby="included-title">
      <div><h2 id="included-title">Fees and preparation</h2></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>The ${coaching.price} {coaching.currency} fee covers a {coaching.minutes}-minute session, up to 15 minutes of preparation, and a brief recap with a practice task.</p>
        <p>Before we meet, send me a short description of what you want to work on. I’ll help narrow it to a useful goal for the hour. We’ll agree on payment and cancellation terms before confirming a paid session.</p>
        <p>Tool subscriptions, hosting, and AI usage are separate. If your task needs more time or work outside the session, we’ll discuss that before planning anything further.</p>
        <p>Recording and transcription are optional and need a separate agreement. If you’d like me to build the automation for your business, see <a href="/services/consulting/">consulting</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <DiscoveryCall service="coaching" />
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
